    '- selector: CSS selector used by the debug overlay to locate the',
    '  element (grep for this to find the code that emits it)',
    '- color: debug overlay color family (blue|purple|green|indigo|amber)',
    '- category: feature area (see categories list)',
    '- notes[].text: the user\'s raw request',
    '- notes[].at: ISO timestamp when saved',
    '- notes[].page, notes[].url: where the user was when they saved it',
    '- notes[].viewport: { w, h, dpr, breakpoint } at capture time',
