    '    - classList / id: element identity hooks',
    '    - ariaLabel / role: a11y semantics',
    '    - nearbyHeading: closest heading text for spatial context',
    '    - targetRect: { x, y, w, h } — viewport-relative bounding box',
    '      at capture time. Lets the processor reconstruct "what the',
    '      user was pointing at" in layout terms (size, position on',
